{"product_id":"gravity-pro-earbuds","title":"Gravity Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eGravity Pro Earbuds Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of immersive, true-wireless sound with \u003cstrong\u003eGravity Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e, earbuds built for people who want premium audio, all-day battery, and a clean, comfortable fit. Whether you're working, training, or commuting, Gravity Pro keeps you connected with crystal-clear sound and effortless controls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Gravity Pro Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGravity Pro is packed with advanced features to elevate every listening session. The \u003cstrong\u003e13mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e deliver rich, full-range audio with deep bass and clear detail across a 20Hz–20KHz frequency range. With \u003cstrong\u003eboth ANC (Active Noise Cancellation) and ENC\u003c\/strong\u003e, background noise is shut out so you stay locked into your music — and a \u003cstrong\u003eTransparency Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e lets you tune back into your surroundings whenever you need to.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCalls stay crisp thanks to a \u003cstrong\u003e4-mic setup\u003c\/strong\u003e with up to \u003cstrong\u003e23dB call noise reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e. Smart \u003cstrong\u003ein-ear detection\u003c\/strong\u003e auto-pauses your audio when you remove an earbud, while \u003cstrong\u003eintuitive touch controls\u003c\/strong\u003e let you manage music, calls, volume, and your voice assistant (Siri \/ Google) with a tap. A dedicated \u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode with 60ms low latency\u003c\/strong\u003e keeps audio in sync with the action, and quick auto-pairing gets you connected in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt tough with an \u003cstrong\u003eIPX5 water-resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e rating, Gravity Pro is ready for sweaty workouts and unpredictable weather.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Gravity Pro Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDriver Size:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.4 (range \u0026gt;10m)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Codecs:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC, AAC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 5.5 hours (earbuds) + ~26 hours total with charging case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 40 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e ~2 hours | \u003cstrong\u003eInput:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C (5V\/1A)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEarbud Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 35mAh | \u003cstrong\u003eCase Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 400mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Control:\u003c\/strong\u003e ANC + ENC + Transparency Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMicrophone:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 Mic, –38dB ±1dB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX5\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32Ω | \u003cstrong\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 115 ±1.5dB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 48.5g (total) | \u003cstrong\u003eEarbud:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32.5×25×27mm | \u003cstrong\u003eCase:\u003c\/strong\u003e 66×47.6×26mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black, Blue, Green\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatible with:\u003c\/strong\u003e iOS and Android\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIn the Box:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds (L\/R), Charging Case, Eartips (L\/M\/S), USB-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Gravity Pro Earbuds?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing Gravity Pro means choosing a complete audio experience — powerful 13mm sound, dual ANC + ENC noise control, and a 4-mic system that keeps your calls clear anywhere. Add up to 26 hours of total playback, a secure in-ear fit, IPX5 durability, and a low-latency gaming mode, and you've got earbuds that keep up with every part of your day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Graphite Black","offer_id":51479303029014,"sku":"24407","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Glacier Blue","offer_id":51479302996246,"sku":"24406","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Seafoam Green","offer_id":51479303061782,"sku":"24405","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/3black_3dd3d127-7006-48b7-832b-35106b9de91b.webp?v=1786617375","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/gravity-pro-earbuds","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}